type: software
abstract: "Implements spatially balanced sampling algorithms on the sphere using sequence-based
  randomization. It offers two distinct methodologies: exact-area continuous sampling
  from vector geodata utilizing Owen-scrambled Sobol sequences, and discrete spatial
  sampling via the H3 global grid system. Both approaches operate natively on unprojected
  geographic coordinates, eliminating the need for map projections while ensuring
  spatially well-distributed survey points."
